{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026j54Mc3Q3Ud1795174570.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>澳門大賽車，排位賽受天雨影響，格蘭披治電單車取消。F4世界盃三度出紅旗，提早結束賽事。</p><p></p><p>四級方程式世界盃排位賽雨戰下，大部分車手只錄得1個完整圈速，包括荷蘭車手哥倫尼，造出最快的2分47秒109。開賽不久就有意外，荷蘭車手史賀曼斯入彎撞欄，越南的阮懷南亦在漁翁灣失控，復賽後又有兩位車手撞車。加拿大的班納特撞得最嚴重，車手沒大礙。</p><p></p><p>原定40分鐘賽事，大會三度出示紅旗後提早終止，選拔賽周六舉行，哥倫尼會排頭位出戰。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.MACAU.RACING-1800_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qNBJaP33CW1795174579.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:03:57.658034+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T17:17:31.244580+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:57:16.191334+00:00","content_hash":"348fd23f37a03ee4ec4e017668c0c9605cc0894faa833970b455ac201dd27e7f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:03:57.658034+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}